<title>USA: Parlux Fragrances sees lower FY sales.</title>
<headline>Parlux Fragrances sees lower FY sales.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Parlux Fragrances Inc said on Wednesday that it expects lower sales for fiscal 1998 since the company is discontinuing some of its product lines.</p>
<p>Parlux said it intends to concentrate on its more profitable product lines.</p>
<p>Parlux reported fiscal 1997 sales of $87.6 million and a profit of $176,223, or $0.02 a share.</p>
